+When `DISCORD_MENTION_ID` is a valid Discord user ID (17–20 digits, surrounding
+whitespace trimmed), every alert ends with `<@USER_ID>` on its own line. Invalid
+values (roles, `@everyone`, `@here`, short numbers, extra characters/newlines)
+are ignored silently. The 1800-character limit covers the mention; when content
+is truncated, room is reserved for the mention so it always survives.
